MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m02_001: 太好了！谢谢你！\n幸好我有和你商量……！
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m02_002: 太好了！谢谢你！\n幸好我有和你商量……！
